          "type": "richtext",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "content": "<ol><li>Offer available to new customers only.</li><li>Limit one rebate of up to $50 per customer, email address, shipping address, billing address, and<br/>payment method.</li><li>All requirements, including submission of rebate request form, must be completed within 30 days<br/>of receiving your order.</li><li>Not combinable with other discounts or promotions.</li><li>“earlybird” code cannot be applied retroactively after placing your order.</li><li>Limited to the first 150 customers using the “earlybird” code at checkout.</li><li>Premium shipping options not eligible for shipping rebate (any shipping method other than $6<br/>Economy Shipping). Product rebate is still available if you choose premium shipping.</li><li>You grant Momtech Inc. the right to use your submitted content for marketing purposes.</li></ol><p>     Additional terms and conditions apply - <a href=\"/pages/terms-conditions-1\" title=\"/pages/terms-conditions-1\">read them here</a>. </p>",
